          "exact_distance_and_interval_check": "Between meetings the rider travels41-65/4=99/4 km outbound and41-30=11 km back, total143/4 km. Dividing by13 gives143/52=11/4 h. Also13/4<67/13<6<41/5, so overtaking occurs before N, the turn precedes the second meeting, and the traveler has not yet finished."
